stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Red
  Red --> Green : timer 30 s
  Green --> Yellow : timer 25 s
  Yellow --> Red : timer 5 s
  Red --> Flashing : fault
  Green --> Flashing : fault
  Yellow --> Flashing : fault
  Flashing --> Red : reset
  Flashing : amber blinks
  Flashing : until a technician resets it

%% ---- diagram-studio layout (safe to keep: Mermaid ignores %% comments) ----
%%@ canvas {"v":1}
%%@ node Red {"preset":"error"}
%%@ node Green {"preset":"done"}
%%@ node Yellow {"preset":"waiting"}
%%@ node Flashing {"preset":"idle"}
